    <li className="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-2"><span>Multilingual voice input (ಕನ್ನಡ · हिन्दी · English) and AI-assisted grounded answers now supported on this deployment.</span><span className="shrink-0 text-[10px] text-slate-400">Jul 2026</span></li>
